OL,3,GNEWSA'Universal park will supercharge
OL,4,Acounty's economy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCreating a Universal UK resort and
OL,7,Ftheme park in Bedfordshire will
OL,8,F"supercharge the economy" in a
OL,9,Fneighbouring county, an expert says.
OL,11,FWest Northamptonshire Council has
OL,12,Fbacked efforts to ensure the area
OL,13,Fbenefits from the #50bn and 28,000 jobs
OL,14,Fthe resort is set to generate for the
OL,15,FUK economy.
OL,17,FRichard Clinton, chair of the
OL,18,FNorthamptonshire Local Visitor Economy
OL,19,FPartnership (LVEP), said the
OL,20,Fdevelopment, due to open in 2031, is a
OL,21,Fhuge opportunity for employment and
OL,22,Ftourism.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
